{
 "ghi_chu": "Atlas mom meo Sensei, 7 khau hinh. Moi o = vung mom duoi cua khung tham chieu (noi-kin khung 0). Alpha THANG (khong nhan truoc): shader tu nhan rgb*a. Mat na dung chung = kenh alpha, giong het nhau o moi o. Toa do lien tuc: pixel k phu [k,k+1]; diem anh o (i,j) (tam) -> toa do tham chieu 540x494 = anchor + ((i,j)+0.5)/scale. Ngoai vung mom moi o dung dung long cua khung tham chieu nen doi o khong lam long nhap nhay. Rau o hai goc tren: giu rau cua khung tham chieu trong loi dac, xoa dan tren dai vien mem (cung mot ban do cho moi o) de rau video noi tiep o mep. Cung vien ngoai dem moi trai da giam ~60% (vung x 224-246, y 255-276). RGB da lam mem nhe cho khop do net video. Doc ca 'gain' (bu sang theo khung, BAT BUOC) va 'bao_ve_mau' (BAT BUOC) truoc khi viet shader.",
