 "chon_atlas": "WebGL1 khong co mipmap cho texture NPOT va khung ve toi da 540 px (1x) -> dung atlas_1x (moi o 1 texel = 1 px clip, khong rang cua / nhay khi dau di chuyen duoi pixel). Atlas 2x chi dung khi ve o do phan giai > 540 px (vd. dung demo offline).",
